  "required_behaviors": [
    "Preserve every chess piece as its own dynamic connected body; exclude from automatic loose-part rescue/welding.",
    "Register real paired-rail prismatic joints and Z guide-bore slider metadata before mechanism compilation.",
    "Use compound/concave-safe guide colliders that leave the physical rail groove open.",
    "Union collinear contiguous co-rigid rack segments, checking normals, gap tolerance and finite strip endpoints.",
    "Register custom board and gaskets with physical colliders; underside artwork has no collider.",
    "Register posed official motor metadata/aliases with A internal rotor at 11.25 degrees and C at 180 degrees; never rotate the stator mounts to compensate.",
    "Implement magnetic attraction/release explicitly; any idealized magnetic latch must be labelled and must not replace physical-force verification.",
    "Await each motor move before updating occupancy; a failed or uncertain pickup must invalidate the predicted state.",
    "Persist current head datum, lift state, piece identities, capture occupancy and state revision with the plan."
  ],
